@base = http://localhost:8082

### Add a word
POST {{base}}/profanity/words
Content-Type: application/json

{ "word": "damn" }

### Add another
POST {{base}}/profanity/words
Content-Type: application/json

{ "word": "hell" }

### List words
GET {{base}}/profanity/words

### Filter a clean text
POST {{base}}/profanity/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "The library saved six kittens today." }

### Filter a text with profanity
POST {{base}}/profanity/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Damn, what a hell of a good story!" }

### Whole words only — should NOT be filtered
POST {{base}}/profanity/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "The damned kittens were hellish." }